 with historical images or body-length reference values), tail-tip wounds, scabs, or abnormal shortening. | 通过爬宠箱固定摄像头，定期拍摄守宫、蜥蜴等爬行动物的尾部图像，利用 AI 视觉分析技术检测尾巴长度（与历史图像或同体长参考值对比）、尾部尖端伤口、结痂或异常短缩。当检测到尾巴长度突然明显缩短（例如缩短超过 20%）、尾部断端可见伤口或结痂时，输出'断尾事件'提示，记录发生时间。", "downloads": 14, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_bb47e3e3/reptile-tail-loss-detection-analysis", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Reptile Tail Loss (Autotomy) Detection | 守宫/蜥蜴尾巴断尾识别", "ownerName": "user_bb47e3e3", "score": 724.6376811594203, "slug": "reptile-tail-loss-detection-analysis", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781379292848, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781106123689, "description": "记录、分析和陪伴成长的长期成长系统。帮助用户通过真实生活经历，逐步建立属于自己的判断力、边界感、创造力和人生答案。当用户谈论人生困惑、成长迷茫、关系问题、自我探索、人生选择、复盘反思、情绪处理、边界建立、责任感培养、创造力发展等话题时调用此Skill。", "description_zh": "记录、分析和陪伴成长的长期成长系统。帮助用户通过真实生活经历，逐步建立属于自己的判断力、边界感、创造力和人生答案。当用户谈论人生困惑、成长迷茫、关系问题、自我探索、人生选择、复盘反思、情绪处理、边界建立、责任感培养、创造力发展等话题时调用此Skill。", "downloads": 14, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_3808b22c/living-your-own-answer", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/5a1e9830-80e4-4cbb-8d00-cee893ca9555.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "活出自己的答案", "ownerName": "user_3808b22c", "score": 759.2190889370933, "slug": "living-your-own-answer", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781379292820, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781144684290, "description": "Generate warm pastel cartoon banner images featuring a user-suppl